        <p class="job-meta">2025.2 – 2025.5</p>
        <ul>
          <li>腾讯云 H20：allreduce EP、int4 deepgemm / deepep、CUDA Graph、MTP；约 21.4→38.9 token/s（+84%）</li>
          <li>all2all EP 与 PD 分离（sglang / mtp / cudagraph）；EP 负载均衡再提约 3–5%</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="job">
      <div class="job-year">2024</div>
      <div class="job-body">
        <h3>量化</h3>
        <p class="job-meta">2024.4 – 2024.10</p>
        <ul>
          <li>INT8 / INT4 均匀与非均匀量化；LayerwiseSearch / SmoothQuant；混元侧量化工具库共建</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="job">
      <div class="job-year">2023</div>
      <div class="job-body">
        <h3>tilearn.llm</h3>
        <p class="job-meta">2023.2 – 2025.2</p>
        <ul>
          <li>tilearn.llm / PEFT / CUDA ops；shard init、TP load checkpoint、FlashAttention</li>
          <li>tensor parallel；HuggingFace PEFT（Prompt / Prefix / LoRA / Adapter）</li>
          <li>ALiBi 融合 FlashAttention v2；70B 级加速与 V100 RLHF 混合并行</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="job">
      <div class="job-year">2021</div>
      <div class="job-body">
        <h3>TI 视觉 / 公有云训练平台</h3>
        <p class="job-meta">2021.7 – 2024.7</p>
        <ul>
          <li>TI 平台 CV AutoML；JIT 图优化、自动量化 / 剪枝；tiacc-slim</li>
          <li>大模型训练市场与加密方案；对外 POC 训推加速</li>
